      "notes": "Prayer of Mending goes on the tank every time it is ready: a 10 second cooldown, five charges, and it is the cheapest healing per mana the Holy kit has. The engine triggers it on the next direct heal its holder receives (not on damage), so keep it on the tank, who is healed most."
    },
