      "notes": "Heal at the band's rank is the mana-efficient filler: once Greater Heal is known, a mid rank of Heal shares its spell power coefficient for far less mana, so with healing power it returns more health per mana than any Greater Heal rank (the classic downrank). Lower ranks of Heal were tried and did not beat it by the one percent the rule asks. Mana pacing: while the mana bar is at least as full as the share of the fight left, the filler fires at the normal thresholds."
